# Fullscreen and back (docs/engine-re.md, "Screen mode") on the title screen. ﾌﾙｽｸﾘｰﾝ (0x9c5a) detaches the menu bar
# and covers the monitor; the pointer held on the top edge past op 0x149's delay (Himegari: 1000 ms) shows AGERC's
# system-menu strip, and its ｳｲﾝﾄﾞｳ (0x9c5b) brings the window back. Each switch runs CALLBACK_WINDOW.BIN and stores
# display:ScreenMode, so SYS4REG.INI ends with ScreenMode=1 on both targets.
# The game takes over the screen while fullscreen: native AGE runs with display:VirtualFullScreen 1 (the sandbox
# setting in tools/drive/himegari.toml), a desktop-sized window instead of a display mode change.
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py native start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py native run tools/drive/scenarios/himegari-fullscreen.steps

wait-state script=TITLE click=adv.next every=3 timeout=120   # click through the logos and opening movie
wait 2
shot fullscreen-0-window
menu fullscreen                         # ﾌﾙｽｸﾘｰﾝ
wait 2
shot fullscreen-1-fullscreen
move 400 0                              # the top edge arms the dwell
wait 0.5
move 401 0
wait 1.5                                # past the delay: the strip shows
menu windowed                           # ｳｲﾝﾄﾞｳ, from the strip's menu
wait 2
shot fullscreen-2-window
expect script=TITLE
